### XcodeGen ###
# The Xcode project is generated from project.yml via `xcodegen generate`
# (or `make project`). project.yml is the source of truth; the project is
# never committed. This overrides the "!*.xcodeproj/project.pbxproj" re-include
# in the Xcode Patch section above.
Spud.xcodeproj/

